    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Denote by T denoting the smoothing transform associated with the Poisson point process with intensity measure µ = δ0 + µ+ as given by (3.2) and its representation (5.1). By induction, we observe that"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
