    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "1 − ψn(4t) = Tn 1 − ψ(4(·)) (t), t ≥ 0. Thus, by Theorem 3.4(b), we infer that ψn(4t) → F(t) as n → ∞ for all t > 0."
