    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "To complete the proof, it remains to show that ψn(t) ≤ ψ(t) holds for all t ≤ 4t0 and n ∈ N0. We will prove the slightly stronger statement ψn(t) ≤ ψ(t) for all t ≤ ak"
